OL,3,ATwelve arrests after protest over
OL,4,Amigrant boat arrival
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been arrested for
OL,7,Foffences including assaulting a police
OL,8,Fofficer after a protest over migrant
OL,9,Farrivals in a south coast town.
OL,11,FThe Home Office said 149 migrants had
OL,12,Fbeen picked up in a mid-Channel rescue
OL,13,Foperation by the RNLI, alongside a
OL,14,FFrench vessel, and were brought ashore
OL,15,Fat Gosport.
OL,17,FFlares were set off and there were
OL,18,Fscuffles with police during the
OL,19,Fstand-off at a marina in the Hampshire
OL,20,Ftown, involving about 150 anti-migrant
OL,21,Fdemonstrators on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
