OL,3,ASpanish PM Sanchez calls early election
OL,4,Aafter housing protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a televised address on Monday,
OL,7,FSanchez said that to push reforms
OL,8,Fthrough he needed "a broader
OL,9,Fprogressive majority" that can
OL,10,F"overcome the resistance of the
OL,11,Felites".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
